      "id": "green-lane-verified-wallet-based-company-formation-and-registration-VUXbMJ",
      "sector": "public_sector",
      "title": "Green Lane Verified: Wallet-Based Company Formation and Registration",
      "summary": "Green Lane is a voluntary digital route for registering a sole proprietorship with KVK or incorporating a legal entity, such as a BV, through a civil-law notary.\nEntrepreneurs retrieve verified identity and evidence data from authoritative sources into an eIDAS-compliant personal wallet and share only the data needed for a specific purpose. This reduces repeated document requests, manual checks and corrections, while giving entrepreneurs more control over their data.\nKVK and notaries remain responsible for all legal, professional and risk-based assessments and may request additional information. Green Lane does not guarantee approval, registration or trustworthiness. Its status only confirms that an agreed data set was verifiably supplied and met defined quality criteria. Verified business data may later be reused through a business wallet for KYC, onboarding and other business relationships.\n\nSubmitted on behalf of the Green Lane collaboration. Pre-pilot fase.",
