      "userJourney": "The entrepreneur voluntarily chooses the Green Lane when registering a sole proprietorship with KVK or incorporating a legal entity through a civil-law notary.\nVerified personal data is retrieved into a digital wallet, while any missing business information is added by the entrepreneur. The wallet shows what data is requested, why it is needed, who receives it and whether it is verified or self-declared.\nAfter consent, KVK or the notary receives and validates the data, while remaining responsible for the legal and risk-based assessment. Missing or conflicting information may require additional review.\nOnce approved, the business is registered and a digital Green Lane statement may be issued. The data and status must be kept up to date.",
