      "userJourney": "For a complete walk though of the end-user's flow, please refer to the demo video available on YouTube (https://youtu.be/nYZhjH3czps). \n\n1.User visits government website (RVO)\n2.User clicks “Go to app” button and arrives within the subsidy orientation page, including 1) a button to find your subsidy with AI, 2) a section that covers subsidies to choose from and 3) an AI chatbot section. \n3.User clicks “find your subsidy with AI” and gets information and instructions on how to chat with AI.\n4.The AI initiates a conversation with a new message in the chatbot section, user has been informed in step 3 to continue the conversation.\n5.At the end of the conversation, a profile is generated based on the conversation. The profile is used to mark how well each subsidy matches the profile with colors: green (great match), yellow (slightly match) and grey (no match).\n6.User selects a subsidy to request, user clicks to go to the request form of the subsidy\n7.User is directed to the login page, login occurs with the personal wallet",
